---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Important information about the accuracy and limitations of Pixelquil's free tools."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">
      Disclaimer
    </span>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Accuracy of tool output</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Pixelquil's tools are built carefully and tested during development, but no automated
          tool is infallible. Generated code, converted files, calculated values, and validation
          results should be independently reviewed before use in any production, client-facing,
          legal, or financial context. You remain responsible for verifying that output meets
          your specific requirements.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Not professional advice</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Content on Pixelquil, including tool descriptions, guides, and FAQ answers, is provided
          for general informational and educational purposes. It does not constitute professional
          legal, security, or engineering advice specific to your situation. For decisions with
          real consequences, security-sensitive implementations, or legal compliance requirements,
          consult a qualified professional.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Third-party references</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Some tool pages reference third-party standards (such as the SVG or WCAG specifications),
          libraries, or services. Pixelquil is not affiliated with or endorsed by these
          organizations unless explicitly stated, and their documentation should be treated as the
          authoritative source in case of any discrepancy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">No guarantee of availability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Tools are provided on an "as available" basis. Pixelquil does not guarantee uninterrupted
          access and may modify or discontinue any tool at any time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If something on this site seems inaccurate, please
          <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">let us know</a>, corrections
          are genuinely welcomed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>